OL,3,ACall of Duty's Activision to make next
OL,4,AHalo game as Xbox cuts more jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FXbox is cutting hundreds of jobs and
OL,7,Fmaking sweeping changes to the
OL,8,Fproduction of its flagship Halo
OL,9,Ffranchise, as its company-wide "reset"
OL,10,Fcontinues.
OL,12,FIts latest reductions, forming part of
OL,13,Fa wave of ongoing layoffs, will impact
OL,14,Fstaff at the studio which currently
OL,15,Fmakes Halo - with Call of Duty
OL,16,Fpublisher Activision to take on
OL,17,Fdevelopment of any future games.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
